Implement operation IDs, expected-revision checks, serialized per-user activation and idempotent retries. Prepare changed upstreams, persist recoverable desired/active revision state, switch new requests atomically and expose status. Specify database-commit/runtime-swap crash windows, startup reconciliation and failed-candidate cleanup. Acceptance: duplicate requests, stale preview, timeout, cancellation, process crash and startup recovery are tested; no false active status or partial routing.
